            &lt;p&gt;Right, I&amp;rsquo;m going to show you something properly embarrassing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This was my bedroom about four months ago. It wasn&amp;rsquo;t just messy – it was a full-on disaster zone. Clothes everywhere, books piled up, random cables, and that one chair that just became a dumping ground for everything I didn&amp;rsquo;t want to put away.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I kept telling myself it was fine. It wasn&amp;rsquo;t.&lt;/p&gt;
